{# Iterative Prompting: Refine through iterations #}
You are an expert AI assistant. Answer the following query by refining your response through iterations.

<query>
{{ user_input|default(query|default("")) }}
</query>

{% set iteration = iteration|default(1) %}
{% set max_iterations = max_iterations|default(3) %}

<iteration_info>
Iteration {{ iteration }}/{{ max_iterations }}
</iteration_info>

{% if iteration > 1 and previous_output %}
<previous_output>
Previous output (iteration {{ iteration - 1 }}):
{{ previous_output }}
</previous_output>

<improvement_instructions>
Improve your answer. Focus on:
- Enhance clarity and accuracy
- Address any gaps or errors
- Keep changes minimal but impactful
</improvement_instructions>
{% else %}
<instructions>
Provide your initial answer.
</instructions>
{% endif %}

<answer>
Your answer for iteration {{ iteration }}
</answer>
